<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- A code list of the UBL example world: data source. Which trading partner the data come from. Shared by DataSourceCode and ComparisonDataSourceCode (qualified variants). Made by tools/build_codelists.py from world/codelists/lists.json. -->
